{#- Checkout route (RouteType::CHECKOUT) — MagicFront flow: render the mff_CHECKOUT widget blob
    (the onePageCheckout template) via the shared page-content template, like Home/Product/Account.
    Its presence is what makes TwigLoader use the MagicFront body instead of the native
    Content/Checkout/Checkout default. getPath('CHECKOUT') = 'Checkout\Checkout'.

    Passthrough only: block content is inherited from mff-page-content (widgetMacros.widgets). The
    onePageCheckout widget is a store-faithful replica whose runtime regions are rewritten back into
    the platform's OSC hooks by CheckoutController::transformWidgetTemplates on the storefront, so
    lc.oneStepCheckout.js drives it. No render logic and no extra stylesheet here. -#}
